      "answer": "$9$",
      "decisiveCalculation": "Set the velocities equal: 5t²=9t+2 gives t=2 or −1/5; only t=2 is after launch. Then x_P=14, x_Q=23, so the distance is 9."
    },
    {
      "qid": 24,
      "questionUid": "sha256:d634108ff68b961a5b9c98ecc395f8264d93eaa96b30c5a5d9cd952166e90859|서술형3",
      "sourceOrdinal": 24,
      "disposition": "RESOLVED",
      "answer": "$a=-6$, $b=0$, $c=5$, 극솟값 $-27$",
      "decisiveCalculation": "The graph of f' crosses 0 and 4 and opens upward, so f'=3x(x−4). Integrating gives f=x³−6x²+C. The local maximum at x=0 is 5, so C=5; hence a=−6,b=0,c=5. f(4)=−27 is the local minimum."
    },
    {
      "qid": 25,
      "questionUid": "sha256:d634108ff68b961a5b9c98ecc395f8264d93eaa96b30c5a5d9cd952166e90859|서술형4",
      "sourceOrdinal": 25,
      "disposition": "RESOLVED",
      "answer": "$25$",
      "decisiveCalculation": "From ∫₀⁵f=6 and ∫₁⁵f=8, ∫₀¹f=−2. Therefore ∫_-3⁰f=∫_-3¹f−∫₀¹f=5−(−2)=7. Also ∫_-3⁰4x dx=−18, so the required value is 7−(−18)=25."
